    "channelId": "UCvxWyn4rfcI2H9APhfUIB1Q",
    "isOwnerViewing": false,
    "shortDescription": "At this Lakewood Water Baptism from October 3, 2026, Joel baptizes hundreds of believers, and we celebrate all of those who have answered the call to follow Jesus and make their faith known. We invite you to witness this transformative celebration, hear some of their stories, and rejoice in God's invitation to walk in newness of life! \n\n \n\"We [are] buried with him through baptism into death in order that, just as Christ was raised from the dead through the glory of the Father, we too may live a new life.\" —Romans 6:4, NIV\n\n\nSubscribe to receive weekly messages of hope, encouragement, and inspiration from Joel! https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvxWyn4rfcI2H9APhfUIB1Q?sub_confirmation=1\n\nFollow #JoelOsteen on social\nX: https://twitter.com/joelosteen\nInstagram: https://instagram.com/joelosteen\nFacebook: https://facebook.com/joelosteen\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@joelosteen\n\n#LakewoodChurch\n\n\nThank you for your generosity! To give, visit https://www.joelosteen.com/donate\n\n\nYou can also watch here: https://www.joelosteen.com/how-to-watch/live",
